      0: 'Did this form submission reach the spreadsheet?'
      1: 'Which form deliveries failed or are still retrying?'
      2: "Why didn't the new signup show up in our sheet?"
      3: 'Show me the delivery status of the latest form entries.'
      4: 'Are any form submissions stuck waiting to be sent to their destination?'
