      1: 'Can you set up a custom policy — does it have any permissions to start?'
      2: 'I want to make a new policy I can attach to users later.'
      3: 'How do I add a brand-new access policy?'
      4: 'Can you create an empty policy for me to configure?'
    identity_policy_delete:
      0: 'Can you delete this custom policy?'
      1: "Why can't I remove a policy that's still attached to someone?"
      2: 'How do I get rid of an unused permission policy?'
