      0: "Can you delete a custom role we don't use anymore?"
      1: 'How do I remove a role, and what happens if someone still has it?'
      2: 'Can I delete one of the built-in roles?'
      3: 'I want to get rid of an unused permission role.'
      4: "Why can't I delete this role — is it still assigned to someone?"
